{"id":"7a32f7aa28ab29ca","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-theorem.md","title":"Theorem","display":"df-theorem — Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-theorem","aliases":["93-df-theorem"],"display":"df-theorem — Theorem","depends_on":["[[93-df-proof]]","[[93-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theorem — Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e0a05ab276dc277\" href=\"?note=4e0a05ab276dc277\" title=\"93-df-proof\">93-df-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> is a deductive-calculus candidate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> is a formula candidate, and its formula carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is recovered from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Thm}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Thm}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\\mathrm{Thm}_{93}(\\varphi,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\\land\\varphi\\in F\n\\land\\exists p\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\\mathrm{Thm}_{93}(\\varphi,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\\land\\varphi\\in F\n\\land\\exists p\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The second argument is the calculus required by the proof predicate, and its tuple binds the formula universe rather than capturing the book-level formula carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-proof","status":"resolved","id":"4e0a05ab276dc277","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Thm}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\\mathrm{Thm}_{93}(\\varphi,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\\land\\varphi\\in F\n\\land\\exists p\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P)\\Bigr]","display":true}],"bytes":877,"backlinks":[{"id":"dfc176599ab6a95f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["4e0a05ab276dc277","c2ca1af9af149e69"]}